OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few scattered light showers
OL,6,Fabout on a mainly cloudy day with only
OL,7,Fa few brighter spells breaking
OL,8,Fthrough. Winds light, mainly from the
OL,9,Fsouthwest.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMostly cloudy in the evening
OL,12,Fwith just a few showers. A band of
OL,13,Fmore frequent and heavier showers
OL,14,Fpushes south into Shetland overnight,
OL,15,Fand reaching Orkney around morning.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FRather cloudy in the morning
OL,18,Fwith scattered showers, heavy at
OL,19,Ftimes. Some brighter spells developing
OL,20,Flater, but with a chilly freshening
OL,21,Fnortherly wind.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
