OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCooler
OL,6,Fon Wednesday and Thursday as a strong
OL,7,Fnortherly wind brings frequent
OL,8,Fshowers, heavy and wintry at times.
OL,9,FScattered showers and a touch milder
OL,10,Fon Friday as winds turn westerly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
